      "trackName": "POYOJI",
      "description": "POYOJI is a small egg-themed puzzle game for Apple Watch.\nEnjoy the feeling of gradually raising your eggs in short spare moments.\n\nMatch and move the same eggs to merge them into the next level.\nOrganize the board carefully and aim for the highest-ranking eggs you can create.\n\nThere are two game modes.\nIn STORY mode, you clear stage objectives one by one. Meeting the conditions lets you move on to the next stage.\nIn ENDLESS mode, you keep playing until the board is full, trying to push your high score as far as you can.\n\nThe controls are simple and designed so the game is easy to play even on the small Apple Watch screen.\nIt’s a game for people who want to enjoy a light puzzle on their wrist during commutes, school breaks, or any small moment of free time.",
